# ADK stays product-agnostic

Do **not** modify `qlix-monorepo/adk_new`, `qlix-final`, or `backend-adk` to add or document PortfolioOS tools.

- Tools and permissions live in `packages/api` (`agent-tools.js`, `domain/`).
- Catalogue: `GET /agent/tools/catalog` — agents must discover tools from here.
- Invoke: `POST /agent/tools/portfolio_os`.
- See root [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).
